35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Whoa, the ledger is wild! Seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire, even if nobody shows up. That’s a lot of money just sitting there!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The sign-in sheets are quiet. A quarter of us do two-thirds of the work, and eighteen names are missing entirely.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, that’s exactly what I suspected. The same nine people do the setup and locking up. They’re carrying the whole club while others just pay.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The treasurer’s logs are stark. Chasing individual payments took six hours monthly, versus one for yearly. We cannot afford that drain.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: The treasurer’s logs are stark. Chasing individual payments took six hours monthly, versus one for yearly. We cannot afford that drain.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, that fixed cost is huge. But my forms show people fear committing to a whole year. How do we balance that?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, that’s tough! But @Toshio, if chasing money takes six hours, maybe we need a simpler way? I’m worried about the reminders too.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the fixed costs are the real anchor. If we charge per event, we still pay the hall. We need a base that covers that, regardless of who shows.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, six hours chasing money is insane. But look at the rota: the same nine people do everything. If we charge per event, they get nothing extra for the work.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Jonathan, the base covers the hall, but the collection method determines the labor. Six hours monthly is unsustainable. We need a structure that minimizes chasing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, that base idea makes sense. But my sign-up records show eleven mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations. That’s messy. How do we keep it simple for them?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, hand-worked math sounds exhausting! I really want to avoid that mess. @Toshio, does a flat fee actually stop the chasing?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, a flat fee covers the hall, but the sign-in sheets show eighteen people never come. Is it fair to charge them the same as the regulars?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, fairness isn't just about showing up. It's about who keeps the lights on. If we charge per event, those nine heroes get penalized for doing the work.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes. A single annual collection eliminates the monthly chasing. The bank statements confirm reminders are a burden. We need that simplicity.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, I agree, the math is a nightmare. But @Jonathan, if we charge per event, the taster forms show people won’t commit to a whole year. We need a simple entry point.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, I’m with you! One simple payment means no more chasing or messy math. It feels so much fairer and less stressful for everyone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I hear you. But the sheets show eighteen people never come. A flat fee feels heavy for them. We need a way to respect that quiet absence.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, eighteen ghosts don’t pay the rent. The nine who show up do. A flat fee protects them from being punished for working.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Jonathan, the eighteen absentees are a loss, not a burden. The labor data is decisive. We must minimize the collection overhead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, I get it. But the taster forms show people fear a whole year. A flat fee is simple, but maybe we need a gentle way in?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
